      "side": 1,
      "message": "This whole loop seems odd to me.  The main goal appears to be a read of a single word with a timeout.  I suspect that the overhead from four polls and reads would outweigh any possible time spent blocked on a read for 4 bytes.\n\nIt seems to me that getting rid of the loop and doing a single read would be better.  And if we are really  something that was written as a Java int I would imagine it would be written to the buffer atomically.",
